{"id":"vod_sn_35553","vodId":"35553","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"紫音之王","name_cn":"紫音之王","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/639be55d96f4c848021afee73a2aff12.jpg"},"summary":"安冈紫音（川澄绫子 配音）有着非常悲惨的童年，双亲惨遭凶手杀害，而年幼的她则成为了唯一的目击证人。因为受到过度的惊吓，紫音失去了说话的能力变成了哑女，住在隔壁的将棋职业棋手安冈信次无法对无家可归的紫音置之不顾，于是收留了她。就这样，紫音来到了安冈家，开始接受将棋训练。　　出生于富贵之家的千金大小姐二阶堂纱织（水野理纱 配音）、男扮女装的斋藤步（朴璐美 配音）、温柔善良的久谷彻，在学习将棋的道路上，紫音结识了这些值得信赖的伙伴们。与此同时，紫音也从未放弃过追踪父母死亡的真相，她发誓要将双手沾满鲜血的凶手捉拿归案。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J2zWACD4RY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TwrX5n8Gjg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/htMS9gnFuw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/whrdiY6sgE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dnzm9R0f9D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BJAW6YMnZV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PWwzU5p2Ut1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5zZYHy31NV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Uun43iuan51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TKgGWtxAE01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xrV3uK9Vw01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TZfhDFBnD21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3U7QxDSfgF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v0ZMNa3UZK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/2